<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fuller raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fuller raised by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating on H.B. Fuller Co to near and long-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 2-1/4 at 38.</p>
</text>
